Build the QGuard Helix AI Security Copilot™ - Name it "Sophia"

Objective

Design, architect, and implement an Enterprise-Grade, Highly Advance and State of the Art AI assistant called QGuard Helix Sophia AI Security Copilot™. Name it "Sophia"

This AI assistant (Sophia) must become the central intelligence layer of the QGuard Helix platform and provide customers with natural language access to all information, analytics, recommendations, telemetry, remediation status, migration progress, certifications, reports, assets, cryptographic posture, and operational intelligence.

Unlike a traditional chatbot, this assistant must operate as an AI Cybersecurity Consultant, AI Quantum Migration Advisor, AI PKI Expert, AI Risk Analyst, AI Compliance Advisor, and AI Infrastructure Architect.

The AI must always answer based on live customer data from the authenticated tenant instead of hallucinating or relying solely on its pretrained knowledge.

